From: KONKR Pocket FIT Elite port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: cq8725s: mark RX SoundWire port 9 as PCM

Master port 9 carries the WCD939x HIFI_PCM headphone stream (384 kHz
PCM); the controller needs its per-port PCM format enable set for it
(soundwire qcom qcom,pcm-ports-mask). Inert unless the HPH PCM mode
kcontrols are enabled.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/cq8725s-ayn-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/cq8725s-ayn-common.dtsi
@@ -1036,6 +1036,7 @@
 
 &swr1 {
 	status = "okay";
+	qcom,pcm-ports-mask = <0x200>;
 
 	wcd_rx: codec@0,4 {
 		compatible = "sdw20217010e00";
